{"id":"cfa80659b9d38f63","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-differential-equation.md","title":"Differential Equation","display":"df-differential-equation — Differential Equation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differential-equation","aliases":["58-df-differential-equation","Differential Equation"],"display":"df-differential-equation — Differential Equation","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-ode.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differential-equation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differential-equation</span><span>Differential Equation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differential-equation — Differential Equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"31710fa05b4ffe92\" href=\"?note=31710fa05b4ffe92\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ode.md\">../batch15/58-df-ode.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0\\in I\">\\(t_0\\in I\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in U\">\\(x_0\\in U\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi:I\\to U\">\\(\\phi:I\\to U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S\\)</span> (typed first-order ODE-solution predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31710fa05b4ffe92\" href=\"?note=31710fa05b4ffe92\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ode.md\">../batch15/58-df-ode.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (bridge predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}equation} \\vdash \\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}equation} \\vdash \\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom is an exact bridge to the typed upstream ODE predicate. The former four-argument predicate left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> free and invoked an unreferenced differentiability predicate.</li>\n<li>ODE: equation involving derivatives; specifies local rate of change</li>\n<li>Existence/uniqueness: Picard-Lindelöf for Lipschitz; Peano for continuous</li>\n<li>Flow: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_{t_0,t}(x_0)\">\\(\\phi_{t_0,t}(x_0)\\)</span> gives solution map; generates dynamical system</li>\n<li>Phase portrait: geometric view of all solution curves; qualitative analysis</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coddington and Levinson, Theory of Ordinary Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Arnold, Ordinary Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ode.md","status":"resolved","id":"31710fa05b4ffe92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ode.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ode.md","status":"resolved","id":"31710fa05b4ffe92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S$ (typed first-order ODE-solution predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-ode.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"t_0\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"f:I\\times U\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi:I\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}equation} \\vdash \\mathrm{DifferentialEquationSolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ODESolution}_S(\\phi,f,I,U,t_0,x_0,n)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_{t_0,t}(x_0)","display":false}],"bytes":1559,"backlinks":[{"id":"8492dafd88e95703","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c0e1663f3cc0bf87","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1beadb4465fe1e39","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-425","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-differential-e